From: SM-G955N Ubuntu port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] adapt reviewed X11 source to current native-window ABI

Use the pinned current uint64 usage ABI; bound fences and dimensions; retain
explicit CPU ownership for X11 transfer. This candidate deliberately uses
XPutImage, without unqualified DRIHybris/SHM buffer sharing. Convert actual
Android channel layout to the X visual with pixman, rather than copying RGBA
bytes into a BGRX image. Original upstream LGPL-2.1 notices are retained.

